This repository contains two kinds of content, licensed separately: code (MIT) and data (CC BY-NC 4.0).
Third-party files in resources/ keep their own licences (see the end of this file).

CODE
====

Applies to all source code: Python scripts (including llm_processing/, evaluation/, data/sampling/,
utils/), prompt templates (data/prompts/, except the letter excerpts quoted in them, see Data), and
configuration files.

